<para>linear exponential correlation model </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes a exponential correlation model</para><para><formula id="163">\[ \rho_{i,j}=rho + (1-rho)*e^{(-\beta \|i-j\|)} \]</formula> <verbatim>  References:
  Damiano Brigo, Fabio Mercurio, Massimo Morini, 2003,
  Different Covariance Parameterizations of Libor Market Model and Joint
  Caps/Swaptions Calibration,
  (&lt;http://www.business.uts.edu.au/qfrc/conferences/qmf2001/Brigo_D.pdf&gt;)</verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
